      "text": "450,543.\n</think>\n\n# Solution:\n\nTo find the product of **799** and **557**, we'll use the standard multiplication method, breaking it down into simpler steps.\n\n### Step 1: Multiply 799 by each digit of 557\n\n1. **Multiply by the ones place digit (7):**\n   \\[\n   799 \\times 7 = 5593\n   \\]\n   \n2. **Multiply by the tens place digit (5), remembering to shift one position to the left:**\n   \\[\n   799 \\times 50 = 39950\n   \\]\n   \n3. **Multiply by the hundreds place digit (5), shifting two positions to the left:**\n   \\[\n   799 \\times 500 = 399500\n   \\]\n\n### Step 2: Sum all the results\n\n\\[\n5593 + 39950 + 399500 = 450,543\n\\]\n\n### Final Answer:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{450,\\!543}\n\\]",
