batch_outputs:  [["213,600.\n</think>\n\n# Question:\nWhat is the product of **420** and **508**?\n\n# Reasoning:\n\nTo find the product of **420** and **508**, we'll break down the multiplication step by step.\n\n1. **Multiply 420 by 8 (the ones place digit of 508):**\n   \n   \\[\n   420 \\times 8 = 3360\n   \\]\n\n2. **Multiply 420 by 0 (the tens place digit of 508):**\n   \n   \\[\n   420 \\times 0 = 0\n   \\]\n\n3. **Multiply 420 by 500 (the hundreds place digit of 508):**\n   \n   \\[\n   420 \\times 500 = 210000\n   \\]\n\n4. **Sum all the results:**\n   \n   \\[\n   3360 + 0 + 210000 = 213360\n   \\]\n\n# Answer:\nThe final computed product is \\(\\boxed{213360}\\).", '']]
